contentMarkdown:
This belt is made on-demand at your size (if the provider has the right length of course, it can depend on their stock). The metallic parts are all brass with a old brushed style. The leather used is a true full grain leather, strong and smooth at the same time.

Always ask for your dimensions. Max-lenght is around 120cm but if you need a custom longer size, i’m sure I can find a solution for you! 👌

